__doc__ = """mr-backup -- recoverable copies of the two loop singletons, kept OUTSIDE every worktree.

    mr-backup snapshot [--file PATH]...        no --file => both canonical sources
    mr-backup restore --file <basename> --to <dir>
    mr-backup --selftest

WHY THIS EXISTS (EARS-1, M-loop-infrastructure.spec.md:356-377). The usage ledger is gitignored
(root .gitignore:37), so git is NOT its backup and it had no recoverable copy at all since
2026-07-24. The handoff is tracked, but `_rotate_handoff` is a whole-file read-modify-write that can
